  PrimitiveEvidence, QualifiedEvidence, PrimitiveDisposition, QueryOverAcceptedProduct, NotACompilerQuery, DispositionClass, UnresolvedClass, PureDagComputationClass, BoundHostEffectClass,
  TargetKernelRealizationClass, CompilerQueryFrontierClass, SeedGrowthOwnership, SeedGrowthRows, NoSeedGrowthRow,
  derive_primitive_disposition, disposition_class, disposition_class_label, row_owner_lane,
